    "Trace separation measures local rim span on paired wall labels, not certified global volumetric thickness.",
    "Small rim facets can touch only one wall where the contour crosses original open-edge closure; they require geometric review, not automatic deletion.",
    "Counts of inherited all-outer/all-inner faces exclude original rounded closing faces with mixed/unpaired vertices."
  ]
}